"note_claim": "The UK is currently pursuing a policy of defensive operations to protect overseas bases, while allowing the US to conduct air strikes on missile sites from uk bases.",
"label": "SUPPORTS",
"quote": "we have given permission for US forces to use long standing basing at RAF Fairford and Diego Garcia to support defensive strikes against the ballistic missiles that are targeting the Gulf.",
